{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a completely new custom Shopify header section for SBL Farms from scratch. Do not modify or depend on any existing header section.
    
    HEADER STRUCTURE:
    - LEFT: SBL Farms logo (uploaded, maintain aspect ratio, width controllable from Theme Editor, vertically centered)
    - CENTER: Navigation — Plants ▼, Seeds ▼, Pots ▼, Services ▼, Gifting ▼, Blog, Contact (NO Home, NO second nav bar)
    - RIGHT: Search bar, Login/Account icon, Wishlist/Heart icon, Cart icon with item count badge
    
    DESIGN:
    - Compact desktop header, short height
    - Soft off-white / cream background (#f9f6f1 or similar)
    - Dark green text and icons
    - Clean, premium, modern, minimal aesthetic suitable for a professional plant nursery e-commerce site
    
    LOGO:
    - Placed on the left
    - Use the logo image uploaded via Theme Editor (image_picker setting)
    - Maintain aspect ratio, no cropping or stretching
    - Logo width controllable from Theme Editor (range setting)
    - Vertically centered in header
    
    NAVIGATION (desktop, horizontally aligned, vertically centered, consistent spacing):
    - Plants ▼ — dropdown with 10 items, each with editable Shopify URL setting: Indoor Plants, Outdoor Plants, Flowering Plants, Succulents, Cacti, Fruit Plants, Herbs, Air-Purifying Plants, Bonsai Plants, Climbers and Creepers
    - Seeds ▼ — dropdown with 10 items, each with editable Shopify URL setting: Vegetable Seeds, Flower Seeds, Herb Seeds, Fruit Seeds, Organic Seeds, Microgreen Seeds, Hybrid Seeds, Flower Mix Seeds, Lawn Grass Seeds, Seasonal Seeds
    - Pots ▼ — dropdown with 10 items, each with editable Shopify URL setting: Terracotta Pots, Ceramic Pots, Plastic Pots, Hanging Planters, Self-Watering Pots, Grow Bags, Window Planters, Decorative Planters, Seedling Trays, Plant Stands
    - Services ▼ — dropdown with 4 items, each with editable Shopify URL setting: Landscaping, Green Walls, AMC (Annual Maintenance Contract), Plant Rental
    - Gifting ▼ — dropdown with 2 items, each with editable Shopify URL setting: Corporate Gifting, Bulk Gifting
    - Blog — plain link, URL editable from Theme Editor
    - Contact — plain link, URL editable from Theme Editor
    
    DROPDOWN POSITIONING (CRITICAL):
    - Each nav item must be a position:relative container
    - Its dropdown must be position:absolute, top:100%, left:0 relative to THAT item only
    - Plants dropdown must appear directly under Plants, Seeds dropdown directly under Seeds, etc.
    - Dropdowns must NEVER shift or appear under the wrong nav item
    - Dropdown widths: Plants ~220px, Seeds ~220px, Pots ~220px, Services ~200px, Gifting ~200px
    - Dropdown opens on hover (desktop); smooth fade-in transition
    - Dropdown has white/cream background, subtle shadow, rounded corners, dark green text, hover highlight on items
    
    RIGHT ICONS:
    - Search bar (expandable on click or inline small input)
    - Account/Login icon linking to customer account page
    - Wishlist/Heart icon (links to /pages/wishlist or editable URL)
    - Cart icon with dynamic cart item count badge (using Liquid cart.item_count)
    
    SETTINGS (all editable from Theme Editor via schema):
    - Logo image (image_picker)
    - Logo width (range, 80–200px)
    - All dropdown item URLs (url type settings)
    - Blog URL
    - Contact URL
    - Wishlist URL
    
    TECHNICAL:
    - Standalone Shopify OS 2.0 section (.liquid file) with full schema
    - Scoped CSS (no bleed into other sections)
    - No dependencies on existing theme header
    - Mobile: collapse nav into hamburger menu with slide-out drawer (basic mobile support)
    - Use Liquid for cart count: {{ cart.item_count }}
    Create a completely new custom Shopify header section for SBL Farms based on the uploaded reference images.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Build the header from scratch. Do not modify or depend on an existing header section.
    
    The final header should look clean, premium, modern, minimal, and suitable for a professional plant nursery and gardening e-commerce website.
    
    ==================================================
    HEADER STRUCTURE
    ==================================================
    
    Create a compact desktop header with this exact structure:
    
    LEFT:
    - SBL Farms logo
    
    CENTER:
    - Plants ▼
    - Seeds ▼
    - Pots ▼
    - Services ▼
    - Gifting ▼
    - Blog
    - Contact
    
    RIGHT:
    - Search bar
    - Login / Account icon
    - Wishlist / Heart icon
    - Cart icon with cart item count
    
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include Home.
    - Do NOT create a second navigation bar.
    - Keep the header short and compact.
    - Use a soft off-white / cream background.
    - Use dark green text and icons.
    - Keep the overall appearance similar to the uploaded reference image.
    
    ==================================================
    LOGO
    ==================================================
    
    - Add the SBL Farms logo on the left.
    - Use the uploaded SBL Farms logo.
    - Keep the logo aspect ratio unchanged.
    - Do not crop, stretch, or redesign the logo.
    - Allow logo width to be controlled from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Vertically center the logo inside the header.
    
    ==================================================
    DESKTOP NAVIGATION
    ==================================================
    
    Navigation must cont, with all sections to be editable and header section i need height increase and decrease also with text will bold 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:#f8f4ec;color:#0d3a1d;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(13,58,29,.12);position:relative;z-index:20}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }} *{box-sizing:border-box}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__row{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:1600px;min-height:{{ block.settings.header_height }}px;margin:auto;padding:8px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo{display:flex;align-items:center;flex:none}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo img{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.logo_width }}px;max-width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(12px,1.5vw,24px);margin:auto}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item{position:relative}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;color:#0d3a1d;font-size:14px;font-weight:{% if block.settings.bold_text %}700{% else %}400{% endif %};line-height:1.3;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;padding:10px 0}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link:hover,.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link:focus-visible{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;width:220px;padding:9px;margin:0;list-style:none;background:#fffefa;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(13,58,29,.14);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(5px);transition:opacity .16s ease,transform .16s ease,visibility .16s;z-index:30}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item--services .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown,.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item--gifting .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{width:200px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item:hover .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown,.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item:focus-within .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown,.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item.is-open .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translateY(0)}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown a{display:block;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:6px;color:#0d3a1d;font-size:13px;font-weight:{% if block.settings.bold_text %}700{% else %}400{% endif %};text-decoration:none}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown a:hover,.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown a:focus-visible{background:#f1f5eb}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex:none}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search{height:34px;padding:0 10px;border:1px solid rgba(13,58,29,.28);border-radius:20px;display:flex;align-items:center}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search input{width:90px;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;color:#0d3a1d;font:inherit;font-size:12px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search button{border:0;background:none;color:inherit;padding:0;display:flex}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{position:relative;color:#0d3a1d;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:25px;height:30px;text-decoration:none}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg,.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search svg{width:19px;height:19px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count{position:absolute;top:-2px;right:-7px;min-width:16px;height:16px;padding:0 4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:9px;background:#1f5130;color:#fff;font-size:10px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle{display:none;border:0;background:none;color:#0d3a1d;padding:5px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer{display:none}
@media(max-width:1100px){.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__row{gap:12px;padding-left:14px;padding-right:14px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{gap:12px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search input{width:65px}}
@media(max-width:850px){.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__row{min-height:{{ block.settings.header_height }}px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{display:none}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;order:-1}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions{gap:9px}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search{width:30px;padding:0;justify-content:center;border:0}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search input{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:100%;max-height:calc(100vh - 64px);overflow:auto;background:#fffefa;padding:14px 20px 22px;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(13,58,29,.14)}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer[hidden]{display:none}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(13,58,29,.12)}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link{width:100%;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{position:static;width:100%;box-shadow:none;border-radius:0;padding:0 0 8px 12px;display:none;opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none}.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item.is-open .sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{display:block}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__row"><button class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18"/></svg></button><a class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}" aria-label="SBL Farms home">{% if block.settings.logo %}<img src="{{ block.settings.logo | image_url: width: 500 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.logo.alt | default: 'SBL Farms' | escape }}" width="{{ block.settings.logo.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.logo.height }}">{% else %}<span>SBL Farms</span>{% endif %}</a>
{% assign menus='plants,seeds,pots,services,gifting' | split: ',' %}<nav class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav" aria-label="Main navigation">{% for menu in menus %}{% assign title=menu | capitalize %}{% render 'sbl-header-menu-items', menu: menu, title: title, block: block, ai_gen_id: ai_gen_id %}{% endfor %}<a class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.blog_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Blog</a><a class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.contact_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Contact</a></nav>
<div class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions"><form class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search"><input type="search" name="q" placeholder="Search" aria-label="Search products"><button type="submit" aria-label="Submit search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.8"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg></button></form><a class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" href="{{ routes.account_url }}" aria-label="Account"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M4.5 21a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0"/></svg></a><a class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" href="{{ block.settings.wishlist_url | default: '/pages/wishlist' }}" aria-label="Wishlist"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.8 8.7c0 5.1-8.8 11-8.8 11s-8.8-5.9-8.8-11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8.8-1.3 4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8.8 1.3Z"/></svg></a><a class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" aria-label="Cart, {{ cart.item_count }} items"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 4h2l2.2 11.2a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h8.9a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.6L22 8H6"/><circle cx="10" cy="21" r="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="21" r="1"/></svg><span class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count">{{ cart.item_count }}</span></a></div></div>
<nav class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer" hidden aria-label="Mobile navigation">{% for menu in menus %}{% assign title=menu | capitalize %}{% render 'sbl-header-menu-items', menu: menu, title: title, block: block, ai_gen_id: ai_gen_id %}{% endfor %}<a class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.blog_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Blog</a><a class="sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.contact_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Contact</a></nav></sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){const tag='sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class SblHeader extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){const button=this.querySelector('.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle'),drawer=this.querySelector('.sbl-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}__drawer');button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const opened=button.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true';button.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!opened));button.setAttribute('aria-label',opened?'Open menu':'Close menu');drawer.hidden=opened});this.querySelectorAll('[aria-haspopup="true"]').forEach(link=>link.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(matchMedia('(max-width:850px)').matches){event.preventDefault();const item=link.parentElement,opened=item.classList.toggle('is-open');link.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(opened))}}))}}customElements.define(tag,SblHeader)})();</script>
